      "description": "Shared text field with semantic focus and invalid states.",
      "html": "<input class=\"ds-input\" aria-label=\"Search memory\" placeholder=\"Search memory\" />",
      "css": ".ds-input{height:32px;width:100%;min-width:0;padding:4px 10px;border:1px solid var(--input);border-radius:var(--radius);background:transparent;color:var(--foreground);font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Geist Variable\", ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;outline:none;transition:color 150ms,background-color 150ms,border-color 150ms}.ds-input::placeholder{color:var(--muted-foreground)}.ds-input:focus-visible{border-color:var(--ring);box-shadow:0 0 0 3px color-mix(in oklab,var(--ring) 50%,transparent);}.ds-input[aria-invalid=\"true\"]{border-color:var(--destructive);box-shadow:0 0 0 3px color-mix(in oklab,var(--destructive) 20%,transparent)}.ds-input:disabled{pointer-events:none;cursor:not-allowed;background:color-mix(in oklab,var(--input) 50%,transparent);opacity:.5}:host-context([data-theme=\"dark\"]) .ds-input{background:color-mix(in oklab,var(--input) 30%,transparent)}@media(min-width:768px){.ds-input{font-size:14px;line-height:20px}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-input{transition-duration:.01ms}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Sidebar Search Row",
      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "navigation-row",
      "description": "Compact ghost navigation row from the Kith sidebar.",
      "html": "<nav aria-label=\"Assistant\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ds-nav\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"11\" r=\"8\"/><path d=\"m21 21-4.3-4.3\"/></svg><span>Search</span><kbd class=\"ds-nav-key\">\u2318K</kbd></button></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-nav{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:6px;flex-shrink:0;height:32px;padding:0 10px;border:1px solid transparent;border-radius:var(--radius);font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Geist Variable\", ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:20px;font-weight:500;white-space:nowrap;outline:none;cursor:pointer;transition:all 150ms cubic-bezier(0.4,0,0.2,1);width:100%;height:40px;justify-content:flex-start;gap:12px;padding:0 12px;background:transparent;color:var(--muted-foreground);font-weight:400}.ds-nav:hover{background:var(--muted);color:var(--foreground)}.ds-nav:focus-visible{border-color:var(--ring);box-shadow:0 0 0 3px color-mix(in oklab,var(--ring) 50%,transparent);}.ds-nav:active{transform:translateY(1px)}.ds-nav[aria-current=\"page\"]{background:var(--sidebar-accent)}.ds-nav-key{margin-inline-start:auto;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Geist Variable\", ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:16px}:host-context([data-theme=\"dark\"]) .ds-nav:hover{background:color-mix(in oklab,var(--muted) 50%,transparent)}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-nav{transition-duration:.01ms}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Task Filter Chip",
      "kind": "chip",
      "refersTo": "filter-chip",
      "description": "Clearable task-list filter from ActivityList.",
      "html": "<button type=\"button\" class=\"ds-chip\" aria-label=\"Clear filter Completed\"><span class=\"ds-chip-label\">Completed</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\">\u00d7</span></button>",
      "css": ".ds-chip{display:inline-flex;max-width:100%;align-items:center;gap:4px;padding:2px 8px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:9999px;background:color-mix(in oklab,var(--muted) 40%,transparent);color:var(--foreground);font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Geist Variable\", ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif;font-size:11.5px;line-height:normal;cursor:pointer}.ds-chip:hover{background:var(--accent)}.ds-chip:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--ring);outline-offset:3px}.ds-chip-label{overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Shared Card",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "card",
      "description": "Shared card primitive with aligned header and content spacing.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-card\"><div class=\"ds-card-header\"><div class=\"ds-card-title\">Files</div></div><div class=\"ds-card-content\">No files yet.</div></section>",
      "css": ".ds-card{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;overflow:hidden;padding:16px 0;border-radius:calc(var(--radius) + 4px);background:var(--card);color:var(--card-foreground);font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Geist Variable\", ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:20px;box-shadow:0 0 0 1px color-mix(in oklab,var(--foreground) 10%,transparent)}.ds-card-header{display:grid;grid-auto-rows:min-content;align-items:start;gap:4px;padding:0 16px;border-start-start-radius:calc(var(--radius) + 4px);border-start-end-radius:calc(var(--radius) + 4px)}.ds-card-title{font-size:16px;line-height:1.375;font-weight:500}.ds-card-content{padding:0 16px}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "Warm paper, ink, quiet companion",
    "overview": "Warm paper, ink, and a quiet companion give Kith a friendly, low-chrome setting. Neutral controls, open space, readable conversation, and a small original sage character carry the identity. The character is an asset, not a new control color.\n\nThe shared web UI also runs inside Electron. Density stays compact in navigation and contextual lists while the conversation has room to breathe. Details appear in contextual panels; the persistent composer and conversation remain the visual anchor. Native setup shares the semantic palette but keeps its own window controls and form geometry.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Warm neutral surfaces with ink actions.",
      "Compact controls around a spacious conversation.",
      "Small original companion artwork.",
      "Contextual detail and restrained, reduced-motion-aware transitions."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The Ink Controls Rule",
        "body": "Use semantic primary for actions, neutral tones for navigation, and success, warning, or destructive only for meaningful status. Identity color belongs to avatars.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Quiet Labels Rule",
        "body": "Use sentence case and modest weight for navigation and section labels. Keep long reading content at regular weight.",
        "section": "typography"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Tonal Depth Rule",
        "body": "Use surface tone, fine borders, and spacing to separate persistent regions. Reserve soft shadows for floating controls and overlays.",
        "section": "elevation"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "Do consume the shared semantic CSS variables and generate palette CSS from the TypeScript source.",
      "Do reuse the shared Base UI primitives before adding custom controls.",
      "Do keep state legible through text and accessible names as well as color.",
      "Do preserve the conversation and composer when opening contextual details.",
      "Do respect system appearance, keyboard focus, and reduced motion.",
      "Do use the original companion asset with empty alternative text when adjacent text names the assistant."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "Don't recolor ordinary controls with the companion's sage identity.",
      "Don't turn secondary details into permanent explanatory chrome.",
      "Don't replace semantic colors with fixed light-theme or dark-theme colors.",
      "Don't reproduce proprietary reference artwork or branding.",
      "Don't carry forward legacy glyph icons, uppercase eyebrow treatments, or fixed-white labels as new system patterns."
    ]
  }
}
